<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-seven-string-bounce" category="High Gain" order="150" instrument="guitar" style="Nu Metal">
  <description>Late-90s nu metal rhythm: a rectified high-gain head in Modern mode with the bass maxed and the mids dug out, into a V30 4x12, gated. Fat, scooped and bouncy for low-A seven-string grooves, syncopated chugs and dissonant octave riffs.</description>
